{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15791","headline":"奉和常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍郎 · 司空曙","name":"奉和常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼凤凰宫，兰台玉署通。\n夜霜凝树羽，朝日照相风。\n官附三台贵，儒开百氏宗。\n司言陈禹命，侍讲发尧聪。\n香卷青编内，铅分绿字中。\n缀签从太史，锵佩揖羣公。\n池接天泉碧，林交御果红。\n寒龟登故叶，秋蝶恋疎藂。\n颜谢徵文并，锺裴直事同。\n离羣惊海鹤，属思怨江枫。\n地远姑苏外，山长越绝东。\n慙当哲匠後，下曲本难工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}